   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">virtual void * do_allocate (<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/size_t\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::size_t</a> bytes, <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/size_t\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::size_t</a> alignment) noexcept=0;</pre>",
